The problem is that the `raw_eq` intrinsic documents that validity is ignored:
https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/baff6033863e38fe5f57242ea99b7f960ce9863c/library/core/src/intrinsics/mod.rs#L2582-L2584

But InstSimplify synthesizes typed copies of each referent:
https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/baff6033863e38fe5f57242ea99b7f960ce9863c/compiler/rustc_mir_transform/src/instsimplify.rs#L321-L376 (and in this case the transmutes are lowered with assumes for the ranges of the operands, which enables LLVM to do funny optimizations).

